flowchart TD
A[Start] --> B[Validate payload\nprofile, choices, customQueries, inputText]
B --> C[Create Transaction pending]
C --> D[Algorithm pass\nRun RuleSetFactory -> Rules.findMatches]
C --> E[LLM pass\nAdapter.call -> spans JSON]
D --> F[Normalize spans\nconvert to global indices]
E --> F[Normalize spans\nconvert to global indices]
F --> G[Merge spans\npriorities + tie-breakers]
G --> H[Resolve overlaps\n should be none after merge]
H --> I[Assemble finalText\napply replacements once]
I --> J[Persist runs & changes\nalgorithm/llm/final]
J --> K{Errors?}
K -- yes --> L[Mark transaction partial/error\nattach errorMessage]
K -- no --> M[Mark transaction success]
L --> N[Respond with finalText if partial + diagnostics]
M --> O[Respond 'finalText, changes, stats']
N --> P[End]
O --> P[End]